"ðə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "line", "ipa": "laɪn", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "broke", "ipa": "brəʊk", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "up", "ipa": "ʌp", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "for", "ipa": "fɔː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "a", "ipa": "ə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "second", "ipa": "ˈsekənd", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Australian and British accents differ noticeably.", "vi": "Giọng Úc và giọng Anh khác nhau rõ.", "pa": {"cau": "Australian and British accents differ noticeably.", "ipa_day_du": "/ɔːˈstreɪljən/ /ənd/ /ˈbrɪtɪʃ/ /ˈæksents/ /ˈdɪfə/ /ˈnəʊtɪsəbliː/", "ipa_noi": "/ɔːˈstreɪljən‿ən ˈbrɪtɪʃ ˈæksents ˈdɪfə ˈnəʊtɪsəbliː/", "tho_noi": "ostrâylyơn-ơn-british-aksents-difơ-nâutisơbli", "tu": [{"tu": "Australian", "ipa": "ɔːˈstreɪljən", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "and", "ipa": "ənd", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "British", "ipa": "ˈbrɪtɪʃ", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "accents", "ipa": "ˈæksents", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "differ", "ipa": "ˈdɪfə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "noticeably", "ipa": "ˈnəʊtɪsəbliː", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Vowel sounds are the main difference.", "vi": "Âm nguyên âm là khác biệt chính.", "pa": {"cau": "Vowel sounds are the main difference.", "ipa_day_du": "/ˈvaʊəl/ /saʊndz/ /ɑː/ /ðə/ /meɪn/ /ˈdɪfərəns/", "ipa_noi": "/ˈvaʊəl saʊndz‿ə ðə meɪn ˈdɪfərəns/", "tho_noi": "vaoơl-saondz-ơ-dhơ-mâyn-difơrơns", "tu": [{"tu": "Vowel", "ipa": "ˈvaʊəl", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "sounds", "ipa": "saʊndz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "are", "ipa": "ɑː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "the", "ipa": "ðə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "main", "ipa": "meɪn", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "difference", "ipa": "ˈdɪfərəns", "nguon": "cmu"}]}}, {"en": "Americans pronounce the letter R in all positions.", "vi": "Người Mỹ phát âm chữ R ở mọi vị trí.", "pa": {"cau": "Americans pronounce the letter R in all positions.", "ipa_day_du": "/əˈmerəkənz/ /prəˈnaʊns/ /ðə/ /ˈletə/ /ɑː/ /ɪn/ /ɔːl/ /pəˈzɪʃənz/", "ipa_noi": "/əˈmerəkənz prəˈnaʊns ðə ˈletə ɑː ɪn‿ɔːl pəˈzɪʃənz/", "tho_noi": "ơmerơkơnz-prơnaons-dhơ-letơ-